   Q('note', 'Upper course valleys are shaped like the letter __________', 'V', 'which is shaped like the letter V', 'The valley is V-shaped.', max=1),
   Q('note', 'A waterfall moves upstream and leaves a narrow valley called a __________', 'gorge', 'leaving a narrow valley called a gorge', 'It leaves a gorge.', max=1),
